{
  "description": "Signatures over the bundle manifest. A key and a signature value are self-describing, `<scheme>:<base64>`, the scheme one of the pinned allow-list `ed25519` and `rsa-v1_5-sha256`; a public key is raw for ed25519 and SPKI DER for RSA, a private key PKCS #8 DER. A key fingerprint is `sha256:` and the SHA-256 of the public key bytes in hex, and a signature's keyId is the fingerprint of the key it is verified with. A manifest signature covers the UTF-8 bytes of the envelope's manifest string, the canonical JSON of the bundle manifest, whose keyId is the fingerprint of the key that signs it and null when unsigned. The keys are test keys.",
